  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br /><br />Current is same, so <math> <mrow> <mtext>P</mtext> <mo>∝</mo> <mtext>R</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />In the first case, it is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math>, in second case it is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math>, in the third case it is <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>r</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;and in the fourth case the net resistance is <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mtext>r</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mpadded lspace=\"+1px\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi>III</mi></msub><mo>&nbsp;</mo></mpadded><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi>II</mi></msub><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi>IV</mi></msub><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi>III</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi>II</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi>IV</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></msub></math></p>"
  }
